# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# LaTeX SOURCE IS NOT PUBLISHED.
# The repository distributes the built PDFs only. Students clone it to read
# slides and pull starter code; they have no reason to build the decks, and
# the source stays with the instructors.
#
# CONSEQUENCE, and it is a real one: a clone of this repository CANNOT rebuild
# the decks. The only copy of every .tex -- including the shared preamble that
# defines the whole visual system -- is the working Dropbox folder. If that is
# lost, the PDFs survive and nothing else does. Back it up somewhere that is
# not Dropbox, or keep the source in a second, private repository.
*.tex
